Yadav,

You need a new column that is something like "station_season". E.g., I have station Bri_01, Bri_02, etc. over nine seasons, so the "station_season" column would have e.g.,

Bri_01_S1
Bri_02_S1
...
Bri_01_S2
Bri_01_S2
...

and so on. Hope that helps clear it up.

Jarrad

